title: 'bridge-grandpa: return dedicated error for justifications signed by previous authority set'

doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |-
      `bp-header-chain` adds `JustificationVerificationError::OutdatedAuthoritySet`. The strict
      justification verifier returns it when a precommit is signed by the previous authority set.
      `pallet-bridge-grandpa` maps it to `InvalidAuthoritySetId` instead of `InvalidJustification`.
      The justification optimizer and the equivocations collector are unchanged.

crates:
  - name: bp-header-chain
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-bridge-grandpa
    bump: patch
